# Selecting a run with Shift+Down, adding a second run elsewhere, coloring them all red with c, moving them all with gm, and undoing the move keeps the colors.
file <<END
Backlog:
	- Login page
	- Signup page
	- Password reset
	- Dark mode
	- Export to CSV
Sprint 12:
	- Fix crash on start
END
keys j <S-Down>
keys j j <S-Down>
see ▌   - Export to CSV
keys c
keys gm
see Move to
type sprint
keys <Enter>
see     - Fix crash on start
see ▌   - Login page
keys z
see   Sprint 12:
hide ▌   - Password reset
quit
saved <<END
Backlog:
	- Login page @red
	- Signup page @red
	- Password reset
	- Dark mode @red
	- Export to CSV @red
Sprint 12:
	- Fix crash on start
END
